Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:06.54,TLLyrics,,0,0,0,,I spun the roulette of destiny
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:08.39,TLLyrics,,0,0,0,,and always watched you
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.38,TLLyrics,,0,0,0,,Why is it that I'm this happy,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.92,TLLyrics,,0,0,0,,yet I feel sad when I look at the horizon?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:11.89,TLLyrics,,0,0,0,,It's as if I'm looking at myself back then, from afar
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:06.01,TLLyrics,,0,0,0,,Spin the roulette of destiny
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.66,0:00:05.92,TLLyrics,,0,0,0,,Thinking too hard about this and that is a mystery
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.17,0:00:12.47,TLLyrics,,0,0,0,,See? The person of your destiny is right there
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.60,0:00:19.19,TLLyrics,,0,0,0,,Watching you always
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.39,0:01:49.87,TLLyrics,,0,0,0,,Watching you always
